      2 · the OUTPUT test. `carrier mass` = the share of the spectrum still
          sitting within +-25 cents of the probe tone. A chorus (or a Haas delay,
          or anything that does not really detune) leaves it near 1.000.
        Throng   copies 1 · carrier mass 1.000  ->  parked (constant detune), not a cyclic pair
